a/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2022-05-24T08:12:58Z","updated_at":"2022-07-09T01:33:57Z","closed_at":"2022-06-08T21:09:18Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-489](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-489)\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nData was loaded from a 200GB csv data in a table with primary key, the tablesize(from platform UI tables tab) was ~695GB. When we try to create an index on this table, we get a timedout error after 3600 seconds. This is observed in transactional mode. (yb_disable_transactional_writes=false)\r\nThe was observed on 8-core 3node universe.\r\nYB version : 2.13.2.0-b32\r\n\r\nError message : \r\n```\r\nCREATE INDEX idx1 on orders(col1);\r\nERROR:  Timed out: BackfillIndex RPC (request call id 306682) to 172.151.34.124:9100 timed out after 3600.000s\r\nTime: 3602379.812 ms (01:00:02.380)\r\n```\r\n\r\nScript : \r\n```\r\n\\timing\r\nSET ysql_max_in_flight_ops=20000;\r\nSET ysql_session_max_batch_size=2000;\r\n\r\ndrop table if exists orders;\r\nselect (pg_sleep(30));\r\nCREATE TABLE orders (id INT primary key, col1 TEXT, col2 TEXT, col3 TEXT, col4 TEXT, col5 TEXT, col6 TEXT, col7 TEXT, col8 TEXT, col9 TEXT, col10 TEXT);\r\nselect (pg_sleep(30));\r\n\\copy orders from '/home/ubuntu/csv_data/orders_10_650m.csv' with (FORMAT CSV, HEADER, ROWS_PER_TRANSACTION 20000);\r\nselect (pg_sleep(30));\r\nCREATE INDEX idx1 on orders(col1);  _(<= this fails)_\r\nselect (pg_sleep(300));\r\nCREATE INDEX idx2 on orders(col2);\r\n```\r\n\r\nTest environment : \r\n```\r\nGFlags:\r\nTablet-spliting enabled \r\nmax_packed_row_columns=1000\r\nSession setting :\r\nset ysql_max_in_flight_ops=20000;\r\nset ysql_session_max_batch_size = 2000;\r\n\r\nROWS_PER_TRANSACTION 20000 (COPY command)\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"jasonyb","id":93959687,"node_id":"U_kgDOBZm2Bw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93959687?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb","html_url":"https://github.com/jasonyb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/12625/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/12625/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}